# The build context is this folder (see deploy/api.Dockerfile), so this is what every image sees.
#
# Installs and build output from the machine running `docker build`. Each image installs and builds
# its own; copying a developer's would put Windows or macOS binaries (sharp's among them) and stale
# dist folders into a Linux image, where they fail in ways that look like anything but this.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.differential

# Checkpoints are mounted at run time and never baked into an image (SEC-05), and they are gigabytes.
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
